# Ignore artifacts:
# `dist` is where vite.config.js actually writes (`build` is a leftover from
# when it did not, kept so an old local tree is still ignored). Without `dist`
# here, running `pnpm lint` any time after `pnpm build` lints the minified
# bundle and reports hundreds of errors in code nobody wrote.
build
dist
coverage
node_modules
src/generated
